onto the streets. Here are the spots worth your time.","venues":[{"name":"Café Abyss","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572116469696-31de0f17cc34?w=600&q=80","description":"A moody, candlelit cocktail bar with an extensive whisky list and jazz playing low in the background. The bartenders here are serious about their craft.","address":"32-8 Wausan-ro 21-gil, Mapo-gu","tip":"Ask for the off-menu 'Midnight Seoul' cocktail — it's their signature and it's incredible.","priceLevel":"₩₩₩"},{"name":"Thursday Party","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1566417713940-fe7c737a9ef2?w=600&q=80","description":"The quintessential Hongdae dive bar. Cheap soju towers, loud music, and a crowd that's always up for a good time. Don't come here for quiet conversation.","address":"19-3 Wausan-ro 29na-gil, Mapo-gu","tip":"Thursday nights are obviously the busiest — go Wednesday for the same vibe with more space.","priceLevel":"₩"},{"name":"Vault 82","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1525268323446-0505b6fe7778?w=600&q=80","description":"A speakeasy-style bar hidden behind an unmarked door. The cocktail menu changes seasonally and the interior feels like stepping into a 1920s bank vault.","address":"82 Eoulmadang-ro, Mapo-gu","tip":"Ring the doorbell and wait — the entrance is intentionally hard to find. Look for the brass plate.","priceLevel":"₩₩₩"}],"relatedSlugs":["nightlife-itaewon","best-street-food-myeongdong"],"tags":["Bars","Cocktails","Nightlife"],"authorSlug":"james-jeong","updatedDate":"2026-03-10","contentType":"guide"}}],["$","$L11","streetwear-hongdae",{"guide":{"slug":"streetwear-hongdae","title":"Where to Shop for Streetwear in Hongdae","city":"seoul","category":"things-to-do","neighbourhood":"Hongdae","neighbourhoodSlug":"hongdae","priceRange":"₩₩ – ₩₩₩","nearestMetro":"Hongik University (Line 2)","openingHours":"11 AM – 9 PM","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441986300917-64674bd600d8?w=1200&q=80","summary":"The best streetwear and vintage shops in Hongdae — from local labels to thrift finds.","intro":"Hongdae's indie spirit shows in its fashion. Alongside global brands you'll find local designers, vintage stores and one-off pieces. Here are the spots worth hitting.","venues":[{"name":"Worksout","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556821840-3a63f95609a7?w=600&q=80","description":"Korean streetwear brand with a flagship in Hongdae. Minimal cuts and limited drops.","address":"Wausan-ro 29na-gil, Mapo-gu","tip":"Check their Instagram for pop-ups and collabs.","priceLevel":"₩₩₩"},{"name":"Vintage Santa","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558769132-cb1aeaede002?w=600&q=80","description":"Curated vintage and secondhand streetwear. Good for denim and graphic tees.","address":"Wausan-ro 21-gil, Mapo-gu","tip":"Go on a weekday for less crowd.","priceLevel":"₩₩"}],"relatedSlugs":["best-bars-hongdae","cafes-gangnam"],"tags":["Shopping","Streetwear","Vintage"],"authorSlug":"james-jeong","updatedDate":"2026-03-10","contentType":"guide"}}]]}]]}]]}]
